# NOT USED UNDER THIS NAME. The build reads a file called algs.list, and
# there is none by default: tdns-mpsigner is then built with the classical,
# built-in DNSSEC algorithms only, tdns-genalgs is not run and no
# dnssec-algorithms checkout is needed.
#
# Rename (or copy) this file to algs.list to declare which PQ-DNSSEC
# algorithms tdns-mpsigner will include support for: every name listed
# below is then resolved and linked in at the next build. Trim the list to
# the algorithms wanted; those backed by a C library need it installed.
#
# Algorithms tdns-mpsigner links an implementation for.
#
# The same registry, names and codepoints as every tdns binary, resolved by
# tdns-genalgs (from tdns's cmdv2/genalgs) against a dnssec-algorithms
# checkout: a DNSKEY this signer emits carries the number every tdns binary
# knows the algorithm by. The hand-written registrations this replaces had
# drifted from the registry, so the same key meant different algorithms to
# the signer and to the servers it signed for.
#
# One registry NAME per line (see dnssec-algorithms/registry/registry.go).
# genalgs resolves each name to its codepoint, caps, package and lib group,
# checks the lib is installed, and emits registered_algs.go + metadata_algs.go.
# Pure-Go (no lib needed):
MLDSA44
MLDSA65
MLDSA87
SLHDSA128S
# liboqs-backed:
FALCON512
FALCON1024
MAYO1
MAYO2
MAYO3
MAYO5
SNOVA24_5_4
SNOVA37_17_2
SNOVA25_8_3
CROSSRSDPG128SMALL
# SQIsign reference lib:
SQISIGN1
